It runs inside an Aquamarine Portal (AquamarineMiiverseTeam) and builds on:

  - rverse2 by rverseTeam, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    (full text in LICENSES/Apache-2.0-rverse2.txt). Parts derived from it, all modified:
      * portal/views/ctr: page markup adapted from rverse2's 3DS Twig templates
        (resources/views/3ds), rewritten as EJS for the Aquamarine Portal's data.
      * portal/languages-3ds: converted from rverse2's PHP translations (resources/lang)
        to JSON by tools/convert_lang.py, with Miiverse/rverse renamed to Protaverse,
        missing strings added and some wording changed (tools/i18n_fill.json).
      * tools/build_n3ds.py reads rverse2's public/ directory at build time; nothing from
        it is redistributed here.
  - Aquamarine-3DS (AquamarineMiiverseTeam): first 3DS port this project started from.

No proprietary Nintendo code or assets are included in this repository. The 3DS Miiverse
stylesheet, script bundle and images are generated locally by tools/build_n3ds.py from an
